# Phase 2 service isolation: load ONLY into the project anchor on Vridhi's Mac.
# Current LAN: edge 10.7.31.231; Backend B 10.7.2.240:3002; interface en0.
# Recheck addresses/interface if the LAN changes. These rules cover IPv4.
pass in quick on en0 inet proto tcp from 10.7.31.231 to 10.7.2.240 port 3002 flags S/SA keep state label "cn-b-edge-allow"
block return in quick on en0 inet proto tcp from any to 10.7.2.240 port 3002 label "cn-b-client-block"
